            %h6#proof_2 Proof
            %p
              We discuss the proof in the special case that
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi 𝔞
                    %mo =
                    %mi X
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} /
                    %mi 𝔤
