              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi d
                    %mi S
                    %msup
                      %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                      %mo *
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} (d S)^\ast
              indeed respects the CE-differentials.
            %p
              On the original generators in
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi 𝔞
