            %p
              for, on the left, the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/infinitesimal+neighbourhood"} infinitesimal neighbourhood
              of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/zero+section"} zero section
              of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/vertical+cotangent+bundle"} vertical cotangent bundle
              of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/graded+manifold"} graded
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/fiber+product"} fiber product
              of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/field+bundle"} field bundle
              with the fiber-wise shifted
              = succeed "," do
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/gauge+parameter+bundle"} gauge parameter bundle
              = succeed "." do
                %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:ShiftedCotangentBundleForCriticalLocusInsideLieAlgebroid"} (8)
            %p
              In
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/local+coordinates"} local coordinates
              this means the following: Assuming that the
