            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#LocalBVBRSTComplexIsDerivedCriticalLocusOfEulerLagrangeForm"}
            below.
          %p
            The following definition
            %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#LocalInfinitesimalCotangentLieAlgebroid"}
