                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Lagrangian+density"} Lagrangian density
            %p
              We now define the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chevalley-Eilenberg+differential"} Chevalley-Eilenberg differential
              on smooth functions on
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msubsup
                      %mi T
                      %mi inf
                      %mo *
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi E
