          %p
            (e.q.
            = succeed ")" do
              %a{:href => "BRST+complex#Barnich10"} Barnich 10 (4.10)
          .proof
            %h6#proof_8 Proof
            %p
              Due to the construction in def.
              %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#DerivedProlongedShell"}
              the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/BRST+differential"} BRST differential
              by itself is already assumed to square to the
            .maruku-equation
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "block", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mrow
                        %mo (
                        %msub
                          %mi s
