            %p
              That this vanishes is the statement of
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Noether%27s+theorem"} Noether's second theorem
              (prop.
              = succeed ")." do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#NoetherIdentities"}
            %p Next we check
